==Description==
The '''Basic Elf''' was the first enemy that appeared in [[Krampus Frosthold]] as part of the [[Krampus' Revenge Event]]. It had a low amount of health and an above average speed for its debut.

==Appearance==
The '''Basic Elf''' had pale skin. It had a green shirt with white fur along the sleeves, as well as stitch lines on the sides of the arms. It had a black belt, dark green pants and black shoes. It also wore a green Christmas hat.

==Strategy==
*The '''Basic Elf''' spawns in dense hordes. Area of effect towers, like the [[Pyromancer]], [[Golden Pyromancer]] or [[Executioner]] can efficiently deal with them.
**Because of how many spawn, single target towers are generally inefficient against it.
*On later waves, towers like the [[Minigunner]] or [[Pursuit]] can be used against it.
**Towers with high splash damage and radius like the [[Mortar]] prove especially effective against hordes of '''Basic Elves'''.

